@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Administrator
rectangle "Smart Campus study room booking" {
  usecase "View availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block / unblock room" as BlockRoom
  usecase "Review usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Send confirmation" as SendConfirmation
}
Student -- ViewAvailability
Student -- BookRoom
Student -- CancelBooking
Student -- ReviewUsage
Administrator -- BlockRoom
Administrator -- ReviewUsage
Administrator -- SendConfirmation
BookRoom ..> SendConfirmation : <<include>>
CancelBooking ..> SendConfirmation : <<include>>

' Assumptions: confirmation is an included step of booking and cancellation; both actors may review usage.
@enduml
